+## 6. Computations
+
+### 6.1 Ring and controls
+
+**MEASURED.** Executable cases use the charged `(d',e')=(2,3)` A/B system:
+`h=H_lambda+D1-lower terms`, `beta=bp*A+bq*y+br*x+bs`, monic division in `y`,
