+H_2[1^6]     = y^2 (y-x)(y-a2*x)(y-a3*x)(y-a4*x)(y-a5*x)(y-a6*x).
+```
+
+**MEASURED.** Per-row source-safe case counts are
+`3,2,3,3,11,2,2,2,2`, totalling 30 in the table order. Conditional counts are
