+| `OPEN[PARTITION-CHART]` | All not-yet-empty strata remain open; a single empty slice never kills a row. | See the exact per-row case and unknown counts in section 5. | After the completed `(24,16)` batch, try `(45,30)` at 44–45 unknowns; generic rows begin at 143. |
