+
+**MEASURED.** Remainders use monic normal form in the declared `y` quotient;
+there is no vanished-leader branch. The map is `(x,y)=(gamma,pi)` in the
+descended chart, and the prime marks are labels.
+
+**DERIVED.** A numeric top face with a free `a_i` is labelled a slice. Only an
+exact empty result for every source-safe symbolic stratum is promoted.
+
+**DERIVED.** This report makes no new exit-price assertion, so it emits no
+`charge_basis={...}` line.

