   283	| (200,120) | `[-120,188,198]` | `{V2=7,V3=3}` | `(4,3,1)` | `(50,30;47;7;k=1)` | 3 |
   284	| (175,125) | `[-125,155,173]` | `{V2=3,V3=4}` | `(5,4,1)` | `(35,25;31;3;k=2)` | 2 |
   285	| (180,144) | `[-144,150,178]` | `{V2=4,V3=5}` | `(6,5,1)` | `(30,24;25;4;k=3)` | 2 |
   286	
   287	### 5.2 Explicit source-safe faces and counts
   288	
   289	**MEASURED.** The frozen driver has no literal `--count` option: invocation
   290	without `--run` is its counting/build-summary mode. The wrapper added an
   291	explicit `--count`, retained the frozen support arithmetic, and checked all 11
