   298	distinct roots. A star marks the 21 cases also surviving the *conditional*
   299	inverse-minor inequality; stars do not confer a source licence.
   300	
   301	| descended row | explicit face families `H_V[partition] -> unknowns` | charged D1-only |
   302	|---|---|---:|
   303	| `(25,15;21;2;k=2)` | `H_2[3] ->145`; `H_2[2,1] ->146*`; `H_2[1,1,1] ->147*` | 148 |
   304	| `(33,22;30;8;k=1)` | `H_8[3] ->28*`; `H_8[2,1] ->29*` | 31 |
   305	| `(35,20;31;2;k=2)` | `H_2[3] ->204`; `H_2[2,1] ->205*`; `H_2[1,1,1] ->206*` | 207 |
