   325	
   326	## 6. Computations
   327	
   328	### 6.1 Ring and controls
   329	
   330	**MEASURED.** Executable cases use the charged `(d',e')=(2,3)` A/B system,
   331	monic division in `y`, and `J(f,g)=c*x^k`. Rings are `dp` polynomial rings over
   332	`GF(p)` or `Q` in the `h` coefficients, slopes, four beta parameters, `c,T`.
   333	
   334	**MEASURED.** Each main ideal contains
   335	
   336	```text
   337	T*(c*Omega)-1.
   338	```
   339	
   340	In the identical declared ring, `<c*Omega,T*c*Omega-1>` reduces to `[1]`, while
   341	`<c*Omega-1,T*c*Omega-1>` does not. Both controls passed on every reported
   342	run. Monic division introduces no parameter-dependent leader.
   343	
   344	### 6.2 `(33,22;30;8;k=1)`
