   355	The union of these two parametric strata covers every partition allowed by the
   356	source constraints, so the top-face gap for this row is closed. Within the
   357	charged A/B chart, the `(132,88)` source row is **SATURATED-EMPTY**, not
   358	`COUNTING-BOUND`.
   359	
   360	### 6.3 `(24,16;17;2;k=5)`
   361	
   362	**MEASURED.** Every system has 162 equations. Four strata completed over all
   363	three primes and `Q`; every basis was `[1]` and both controls passed:
   364	
   365	| partition | unk | build | modular times (s) | `Q` (s) |
   366	|---|---:|---:|---|---:|
   367	| `[6]` | 35 | 55.947 s | 0.016, 0.016, 0.016 | 0.016 |
