   370	| `[3,3]` | 36 | 126.905 s | 2.539, 2.545, 2.537 | 2.776 |
   371	
   372	**MEASURED.** The first prime (`32003`) timed out after 600 s for `[4,1,1]`,
   373	`[3,2,1]`, and `[2,2,1,1]`, with respectively 37, 37, and 38 unknowns.
