   377	The current driver decodes that output before serialization.
   378	
   379	**MEASURED.** Following the bounded-stop rule, `[3,1,1,1]`, `[2,2,2]`,
   380	`[2,1,1,1,1]`, and `[1,1,1,1,1,1]` were not launched. Consequently this row
   381	remains `COUNTING-BOUND`. The durable post-run record distinguishes measured
