+
+## 6. Computations
+
+### 6.1 Ring and controls
+
+**MEASURED.** Executable cases use the charged `(d',e')=(2,3)` A/B system,
+monic division in `y`, and `J(f,g)=c*x^k`. Rings are `dp` polynomial rings over
