+| `[3]`: `y^8(y-x)^3` | 28 | 62 | 9.433 s | three `[1]`, 0.007 s each | `[1]`, 0.007 s |
+| `[2,1]`: `y^8(y-x)^2(y-a2*x)` | 29 | 62 | 13.190 s | three `[1]`, 0.009 s each | `[1]`, 0.009 s |
+
+**MEASURED verdict.** Both exact bases have size one and both controls pass.
