+| (180,144) | `[-144,150,178]` | `{V2=4,V3=5}` | `(6,5,1)` | `(30,24;25;4;k=3)` | 2 |
+
+### 5.2 Explicit source-safe faces and counts
+
+**MEASURED.** The frozen driver has no literal `--count` option: invocation
+without `--run` is its counting/build-summary mode. The wrapper added an
