+
+| descended row | explicit face families `H_V[partition] -> unknowns` | charged D1-only |
+|---|---|---:|
+| `(25,15;21;2;k=2)` | `H_2[3] ->145`; `H_2[2,1] ->146*`; `H_2[1,1,1] ->147*` | 148 |
