+
+**MEASURED.** Following the bounded-stop rule, `[3,1,1,1]`, `[2,2,2]`,
+`[2,1,1,1,1]`, and `[1,1,1,1,1,1]` were not launched. Consequently this row
+remains `COUNTING-BOUND`. The durable post-run record distinguishes measured
